"a0.lao_start_ww","ww","Y","None","None","Row","n","Intel workweek in which testing of the lot at the particular operation started. This value is originally stored in A_LOT_AT_OPERATION, and then redundantly copied in many tables that refer to a lot at an operation (directly in indirectly). Thus, all test results for a particular lot at an operation will have the same value for this workweek. This column value is also used for partitioning tables. Format is YYYYWW","a_testing_session","a0->ats.lao_start_ww","col23"
