"a0.complevel_1","complevel_1","Y","None","None","Row","c","This column stores the name of the 1st level component of a device . Ex. Resistance, transistor etc. A device may or may not have a 1st level component. No other attribute of this object is stored in the database","a_all_component_testing_result","a0->ctr.complevel_1","col8"
"a0.complevel_2","complevel_2","Y","None","None","Row","c","This column stores the name of the 2nd  level component of a device . Ex. Pads on an interposer,  etc. A device may or may not have a 2nd  level component. No other attribute of this object is stored in the database","a_all_component_testing_result","a0->ctr.complevel_2","col9"
"a0.test_name","test_name","Y","None","None","Header","c","Name of the test to be performed on the device","a_test","a0->t.test_name","col10"
